        "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/44#discussion_r3788963504",
        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Canonicalize the WatchFn installation root**\n\nWhen the authenticated scope uses the canonical `installationId` without also populating the deprecated `organizationId` alias, every WatchFn admin operation fails this comparison because `WatchFnAdminScope.organizationId` is required while `actual.organizationId` is undefined. Super Console explicitly accepts installation-only roots, so compare both sides through `installationId ?? organizationId`; the same direct-alias comparison also affects the nested LogFn and CatchFn scope checks.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
