        "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/44#discussion_r3788963507",
        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Remove or implement the alert status filter**\n\nWhen a caller supplies `status`, this operation still returns every alert: `createWatchFnAdminService` forwards the value to `watch.alerts.list`, but `AlertManager.list` ignores its filter and the stored alert definitions do not contain a status field. This makes filtered admin/API results silently incorrect; either define and apply an alert status model or remove the unsupported input.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
      }
    },
