        "author": "chatgpt-codex-connector",
        "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/44#discussion_r3794045612",
        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve installationId in scoped URLs**\n\nWhen an operator selects a non-default installation through the documented `installationId` query parameter, `withAdminScope` silently drops it because only the deprecated `organizationId` alias is copied. Subsequent navigation and API requests then fall back to the principal's default installation, potentially displaying or mutating the wrong tenant's data. Include `installationId` as the canonical root while retaining `organizationId` compatibility.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
