        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Keep the active scope on CiFn child links**\n\nWhen this run was opened under a non-default workspace, project, environment, namespace, or installation, clicking Artifacts discards every scope query parameter and reloads against the principal's default scope; the analogous View logs link below does the same. Wrap both destinations with `scopedConsoleHref(..., page.url.searchParams)` so child pages query the same scoped run.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
