        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve the MailFn service receiver**\n\nWhen a caller supplies a class-based `MailFnAdminService` whose methods access `this`, extracting each method and invoking it as a plain function loses the receiver, causing every affected operation to throw or read undefined state. Pass the service into `bind` and invoke the handler with `handler.call(service, ...)`, as the BrowseFn adapter does.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
