        "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/44#discussion_r3801960916",
        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Continue through all MailFn message pages**\n\nWhen an inbox contains more than 100 matching messages, this reads only the first domain page and discards its `nextCursor`. Consequently `mailfn.messages.list` can never expose later messages, and `mailfn.attachments.list` also omits attachments belonging to them regardless of the admin cursor. Iterate each inbox's domain cursor or implement cursor-aware aggregation rather than treating this bounded page as the complete project history.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
