        "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/44#discussion_r3801960925",
        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Translate MailFn domain errors into admin errors**\n\nWhen an inbox ID is missing or outside the active project, `mailfn.getInbox` throws `MailFnError`, but this service does not translate it to `AdminError`. The shared dispatcher normalizes every non-`AdminError` exception to a generic 500, so ordinary not-found, validation, conflict, and rate-limit outcomes from MailFn are reported as internal failures; wrap MailFn calls with a status/code translator before they reach the dispatcher.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
