        "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/44#discussion_r3801960935",
        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Apply the declared MailFn search input**\n\nWhen the generic resource toolbar sends `q`, the server maps it to the declared `search` property, but `listMessages` reads only `input.filter` and silently ignores `input.search` (and the common list schema exposes the same unsupported field for every MailFn resource). The request therefore succeeds with an unfiltered result, making the console's search control a no-op; apply the search or remove/reject it for resources that cannot support it.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
