        "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/44#discussion_r3801960939",
        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Expose later SecFn namespace pages**\n\nWhen a tenant has more namespaces than the requested limit (50 by default), this permanently discards the remainder while the list envelope reports `nextCursor: null`; the namespace input schema has no cursor or offset either, so neither the console nor an API client can retrieve later entries. Return all values or add real cursor pagination; the environments branch below has the same truncation.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
