        "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next/pull/44#discussion_r3804538414",
        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Clear stale namespace and region when switching scope**\n\nWhen an operator changes the installation, workspace, project, or environment without explicitly supplying `namespace` or `region`, these lines restore those values from the principal's old default scope. This affects the context switcher directly: `switchAdminContextHref` deliberately deletes both parameters, but the next server request adds them back, so authorization and module operations can target a stale namespace/region in the newly selected environment. Only inherit these defaults when no hierarchy level changed.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
