        "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Route CatchFn resources through the mounted child path**\n\nWhen CatchFn is enabled under WatchFn, the folded resource URL is generated as `/modules/watchfn/errors/bug-reports` from this mount path. No matching CatchFn list route exists there: the added Svelte route is `/modules/[moduleId]/catchfn/[resource]`, while the generated URL is interpreted by the generic detail route as WatchFn resource `errors` with ID `bug-reports`, producing an unavailable-resource page. Use the actual `/modules/watchfn/catchfn` mount or add routes for the declared alias.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
