    "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve composite identifiers when loading resource details**\n\nInclude the other required operation inputs when materializing a detail request. A FlowFn job detail requires both `queue` and `id`, and FileFn version/artifact details require `fileId` plus `id`, but this supplies only the target ID; row navigation also drops the list's `queue` or `fileId` query parameter, so opening those records reaches the real detail operation with an invalid input and returns a validation error.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
