    "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Use the manifest's declared ID field for resource rows**\n\nUse each resource's declared `idField` rather than guessing from its plural name. For example, CmsFn document rows identify themselves with `_id`, while FileFn grants use `permissionId`; neither key is considered by `adminItemId`, so these valid records receive synthetic `row-*` IDs and no detail link or bound row actions even though their manifests explicitly define the identity field.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
